	\L_07697:
	\L_07571:
	ZH 1:
	'Dance.'
	\L_076a4:
	\L_07697:
	\L_075e1:
	ZH 1:
	'Hah??'
	\L_076a4:
	\L_07697:
	\L_07571:
	ZH 1:
	'When the door to Amano-Iwato'
	R
	'was closed, a girl did a dance,'
	R
	'and the person inside made an'
	R
	'opening to watch.'
	\L_076a4:
	ZH 1:
	'Then the men were able to pry'
	R
	'the door open.'
	\L_076a4:
	ZH 1:
	'That... means...'
