	\L_076a4:
	\L_07697:
	\L_075e1:
	ZH 1:
	'M-Me...?'
	\L_076a4:
	\L_07697:
	\L_07571:
	ZH 1:
	'That’s right.'
	R
	'You dance, Maris.'
	\L_076a4:
	ZH 1:
	'You can do pretty much'
